{"locales":{"en":{"nryoseke1l":{"title":"Didn\u2019t find an answers to your questions?","des_html":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><b style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">The name says it all<\/b><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">.<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">From the Latin <i>de.cor.is<\/i>, meaning \"beautiful\"<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">DECORIS exists to bring intentional beauty<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">into the spaces we live, work, and play in.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->","button_html":"&or;"},"oz7j287qgmn":{"lh_hnlpsm_desc_html":"At <b>DECORIS<\/b>, we\u2019re transforming the way you experience\nart. Instead of static prints that never change, our\n<b>subscription service<\/b> keeps your walls alive with fresh,\noriginal photography\u2014framed, delivered, and ready to\nrefresh on your schedule.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"esfxpolbe4k":{"lh_a168_title":"Why Subscription Matters","lh_a168_desc_html":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.06rem;\">Traditional art is a one-time purchase. It fades, it dates, and it\nquickly becomes invisible.<br><b>\nDECORIS is different<\/b>. With our subscription service, you\ndecide how often your images change. Every delivery brings a\nnew story, keeping your space inspiring and current without the\nhassle of buying again and again.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"wke5l51zr9s":{"lh_hnlpsm_title":"What Makes DECORIS Different","lh_hnlpsm_desc_html":"<b>100% Original Photography<\/b> \u2013 never stock,\nnever AI. Every image is captured by our global\nteam of photographers.<br><br><b>\n\nFramed and Ready<\/b> \u2013 choose your size and\nframe color; your first image arrives ready to\nhang.<br><br><b>\n\nDynamic Image Refresh<\/b> \u2013 you select new\nimages when it suits you or we can select them\nfor you based upon your initial preferences.<br><br><b>\n\nSimplicity<\/b> \u2013 When your new images arrive you\nsimply unroll into the back of your frames.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"1qjbxh7pwsu":{"lh_a168_title":"For Every Customer","lh_a168_desc_html":"<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0px;\"><b>Residents &amp; Homeowners<\/b> \u2013 elevate your\nliving space with artwork that grows with you.<br><br><b>\n\nGift Buyers<\/b> \u2013 give a subscription that keeps\ndelivering joy long after the occasion.\n<br><br><b>\nBusinesses &amp; Facilities<\/b> \u2013 keep\nenvironments dynamic, professional, and\nbrand-aligned.<\/span><\/div><!--lh-live-editor-->"},"ttvinc9vak":{"lh_hnlpsm_title":"Get Started Today","lh_hnlpsm_desc_html":"Transform your walls into a living gallery. With\nDECORIS, you\u2019re not just decorating\u2014you\u2019re\nsubscribing to an experience that evolves with\nyou:<br><br>\n\n\u2714 Choose your image<br>\n\u2714 Pick your frame size & color<br>\n\u2714 Select your subscription plan<br>\n\u2714 Enjoy effortless image refreshes, delivered\nto your door<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"4offhsz7qsp":{"lh_a168_title_html":"DECORIS is more than artwork\u2014it\u2019s a <br>subscription to beauty, elegance, and inspiration","lh_a168_desc_html":"It is a long established fact that a reader will be distracted by the readable <br>content of a page when looking at its layout.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_8huk_link":"Get Started"},"dcu09jya1fk":{"title":"Banner video test"}}},"name":"Standard page"}
